@startuml
title MedRx Doctor - component diagram
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor Doctor
component "Web UI" as UI
package "Agents" {
  component "Orchestrator" as ORCH
  component "Interaction check agent" as CHECK
}
component "Guardrail layer\n(input check, output check)" as GUARD
component "Approval gate\n(HIGH interaction)" as GATE
component "LLM adapter\n(retry, timeout, circuit breaker)" as LLMA
package "MCP servers" {
  component "drug-info server" as DRUG
  component "leaflet-RAG server" as RAG
}
database "Leaflet store" as VS
cloud "Gemini API\n(primary)" as GEM
cloud "Groq API\n(fallback)" as GRQ

Doctor --> UI
UI --> ORCH : HTTP / JSON
ORCH --> CHECK
CHECK --> DRUG : MCP tools
CHECK --> RAG : MCP tools
RAG --> VS
CHECK --> GUARD
GUARD --> LLMA
LLMA --> GEM
LLMA --> GRQ : if primary fails
ORCH --> GATE : HIGH interaction
UI ..> GATE : approve / reject (physician only)

' Requirement IDs (spec v1.2): GUARD FR-11, FR-12; GATE FR-09, FR-10; LLMA FR-07, NFR-01, NFR-06

@enduml
